/// 🏷️ The declared column-type tag — mirrors `SemioValue`'s SCALAR variant names only (`Null`/
/// `Bool`/`Int`/`Float`/`Str`/`Bytes`; no `List`/`Map`/`Ref` — a column's cells are meant to be
